<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:34,240
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Roar! Howl!</font>

26
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:34,240
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{The Ultimate Tag</font>

27
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo!</font>

28
00:01:35,150 --> 00:01:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got you!</font>

29
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

30
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?!</font>

31
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:57,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I felt a response to my attack
but it didn't work.</font>

32
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And where did his attack
come from?</font>

33
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, Akamaru.</font>

34
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're gonna attack from both sides
with Fang Over Fang.</font>

35
00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:14,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we go!</font>

36
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over Fang!</font>

37
00:02:22,370 --> 00:02:23,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

38
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:35,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This doesn't look so good.</font>

39
00:02:38,050 --> 00:02:40,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll play a melody of death for you.</font>

40
00:02:48,230 --> 00:02:49,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with this guy?</font>

41
00:02:52,020 --> 00:02:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

42
00:02:55,530 --> 00:02:59,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two on two is perfect
right, Sakon?</font>

43
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:10,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could the Sound Ninja Four
take so much time?</font>

44
00:03:11,330 --> 00:03:14,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did they send such strong people
after them who could hold them up...</font>

45
00:03:15,460 --> 00:03:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or are they playing around too much?</font>

46
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the one that's probably
delaying things is...</font>

47
00:03:24,510 --> 00:03:29,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">either Jirobo who gets hungry a lot
or Kidomaru who likes to play.</font>

48
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the one that's
the most dangerous</font>

49
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when he loses his temper
is Sakon.</font>

50
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:37,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not satisfied until
he kills his opponent</font>

51
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:39,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though he should
just leave things be.</font>

52
00:03:40,450 --> 00:03:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He thinks he's the strongest of
the four so he shows off.</font>

53
00:03:46,370 --> 00:03:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if that's so...</font>

54
00:03:48,290 --> 00:03:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tayuya has a personality that's
neck and neck with Sakon.</font>

55
00:03:52,250 --> 00:03:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But in any case,
nothing bad will happen</font>

56
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:57,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">since we sent that kid...</font>

57
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kimimaro.</font>

58
00:04:01,260 --> 00:04:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll surely clean up anything that is
not good for me.</font>

59
00:04:18,230 --> 00:04:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will never let you take Sasuke!</font>

60
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a lot of trash scattered about.</font>

61
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But after all trash is trash.</font>

62
00:04:30,330 --> 00:04:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It simply needs to be cleaned up.</font>

63
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

64
00:04:38,090 --> 00:04:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on.</font>

65
00:04:40,210 --> 00:04:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll crush you!</font>

66
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the so-called
melody of death.</font>

67
00:05:41,110 --> 00:05:42,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So she's manipulating them
with the sound of the flute.</font>

68
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! She's getting
further and further away.</font>

69
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:05,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?!
What is it that I should do?!</font>

70
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

71
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:09,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is really looking bad!</font>

72
00:06:22,060 --> 00:06:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru!</font>

73
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, so you're the real one!</font>

74
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multiple Fists Barrage!</font>

75
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:33,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more!</font>

76
00:06:40,370 --> 00:06:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My brother and I get along very well.</font>

77
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:46,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Usually my older brother Ukon
sleeps inside of me</font>

78
00:06:46,710 --> 00:06:50,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but when there's a fight
he comes out and helps out.</font>

79
00:06:51,590 --> 00:06:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is this guy's ability.</font>

80
00:06:53,930 --> 00:06:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ukon can stick out
his arms, legs and his head</font>

81
00:06:56,890 --> 00:07:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from anywhere in my body
and attacks or defends.</font>

82
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like this you see...</font>

83
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multiple Legs Barrage!</font>

84
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:16,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a three-legged kick.
Works well, doesn't it?</font>

85
00:07:16,410 --> 00:07:17,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So next it's...!</font>

86
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time to waste, Sakon.</font>

87
00:07:28,090 --> 00:07:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll finish this quickly!
Get into the second state!</font>

88
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, all right...</font>

89
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:43,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too impatient, aniki.</font>

90
00:07:50,700 --> 00:07:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see you're saying those horns
aren't just for display, huh?</font>

91
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As soon as that right one came out,</font>

92
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his Chakra increased
by several tenfold.</font>

93
00:08:02,330 --> 00:08:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

94
00:08:03,710 --> 00:08:06,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seemed hopeless before
but now it's really bad.</font>

95
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:12,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your liking, aniki?</font>

96
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:14,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In pieces.</font>

97
00:08:43,330 --> 00:08:46,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So now,
perhaps it's time to get serious.</font>

98
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of you all at once.</font>

99
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such confident words!
But those are my lines!</font>

100
00:09:02,310 --> 00:09:04,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap! These guys are persistent!</font>

101
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:08,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's starting to
get clearer to me.</font>

102
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:17,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the problem is
from here on out.</font>

103
00:09:22,330 --> 00:09:25,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Am I completely out of hands?</font>

104
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:30,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! You're saying
we're gonna do that?!</font>

105
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:33,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, Akamaru!</font>

106
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too dangerous to do it here
without our comrades!</font>

107
00:09:37,430 --> 00:09:38,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand, don't you?</font>

108
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we use that Jutsu,</font>

109
00:09:40,810 --> 00:09:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">both you and I will use up
most of our Chakra</font>

110
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:44,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and won't be able to move.</font>

111
00:09:45,730 --> 00:09:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we miss, we'll die here in vain.</font>

112
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

113
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:08,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pitiful master I am...
that you had to bite me.</font>

114
00:10:10,130 --> 00:10:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand, Akamaru.</font>

115
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like you said
we only have that left!</font>

116
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wolf Fang Over Fang!</font>

117
00:10:32,060 --> 00:10:33,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, Akamaru!</font>

118
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:35,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

119
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it well... Akamaru!</font>

120
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:40,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show them the results of the training!</font>

121
00:10:45,490 --> 00:10:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Dynamic Marking!</font>

122
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Playing dirty like that!</font>

123
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All preparations are done!</font>

124
00:10:55,130 --> 00:10:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inuzuka-Style!
Man-Beast Transformation Combo!</font>

125
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two-Headed Wolf!</font>

126
00:11:19,610 --> 00:11:20,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wondered what it was going
to be and</font>

127
00:11:20,990 --> 00:11:23,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it turned out to be
a drooling runt of a dog.</font>

128
00:11:23,530 --> 00:11:25,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What can a dog like this do?</font>

129
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

130
00:11:34,670 --> 00:11:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Drool?!</font>

131
00:11:35,750 --> 00:11:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakon, what're you doing!
To the right!</font>

132
00:11:38,010 --> 00:11:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

133
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:40,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wolf Fang Over Fang!</font>

134
00:12:00,780 --> 00:12:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! How's that!</font>

135
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:05,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wolf Fang Over Fang revolution speed
is too fast.</font>

136
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's such an intense high revolution that
even our visibility becomes zero.</font>

137
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:12,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even without direct contact
flesh is cut...</font>

138
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:14,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A direct hit from the blow
and you're in pieces.</font>

139
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really... getting carried away...</font>

140
00:12:41,990 --> 00:12:46,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is perfect.
We were just thinking of separating soon.</font>

141
00:12:46,490 --> 00:12:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! He divided into two people?!</font>

142
00:12:49,830 --> 00:12:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true...</font>

143
00:12:52,830 --> 00:12:55,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Had we fully received the blow as one
it would've been bad but...</font>

144
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:58,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real battle begins now.</font>

145
00:12:59,300 --> 00:13:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

146
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... I know, Akamaru.</font>

147
00:13:06,930 --> 00:13:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more shot of
Wolf Fang Over Fang.</font>

148
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The next one is our limit.</font>

149
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll take them down with this!</font>

150
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:16,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wolf Fang Over Fang!</font>

151
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:24,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use hiding!</font>

152
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:27,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you we don't chase
with our eyes!</font>

153
00:13:27,780 --> 00:13:31,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We attack by chasing smells
we've marked with our noses!</font>

154
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— A!
— Un!</font>

155
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Summoning...
— Summoning...</font>

156
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Rashomon!
— Rashomon!</font>

157
00:13:59,610 --> 00:14:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's an impressive power...</font>

158
00:14:01,650 --> 00:14:03,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To turn Rashomon,</font>

159
00:14:03,530 --> 00:14:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the ultimate shield to protect
