160
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:08,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

161
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This is the end!
