<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

167
00:14:37,180 --> 00:14:40,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...!
This time it's not ordinary piss!</font>

168
00:14:41,060 --> 00:14:44,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It feels like my eyes are burning
