169
00:14:45,610 --> 00:14:46,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the other one?!</font>

170
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:48,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

171
00:14:50,820 --> 00:14:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you looking for?</font>

172
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:58,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of the rest.
Go wash your eyes in that river.</font>

173
00:15:03,290 --> 00:15:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my ability...
specialized in assassination of course.</font>

174
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't beat me by
just having a good nose and nails.</font>

175
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:15,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't beat my ability!</font>

176
00:15:17,810 --> 00:15:20,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know that the Chakra Network
through which Chakra flows</font>

177
00:15:20,190 --> 00:15:23,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is deeply interwoven with each
internal organ, right?</font>

178
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:29,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chakra Network is interwoven
in a variety of complicated ways</font>

179
00:15:29,450 --> 00:15:32,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and is linked to the tissues that
make up each organ.</font>

180
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:35,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also to each cell that makes up
the tissues</font>

181
00:15:35,580 --> 00:15:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as well as even to proteins
which are the main component of cells...</font>

182
00:15:40,830 --> 00:15:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the second state,</font>

183
00:15:42,330 --> 00:15:47,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can dismantle or reconstruct these cells
or proteins as I wish by using Chakra.</font>

184
00:15:49,170 --> 00:15:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To put it simply,</font>

185
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:54,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can turn my body into tiny pieces,
enter my opponent's body...</font>

186
00:15:54,090 --> 00:15:57,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">return to my original form
and come back out.</font>

187
00:15:58,140 --> 00:15:59,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

188
00:16:00,390 --> 00:16:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry... Akamaru...!</font>

189
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've always done things together...</font>

190
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we were together
always and everywhere.</font>

191
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:18,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo! Good boy, Akamaru!</font>

192
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:25,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo! We're lucky that the people
