193
00:16:25,540 --> 00:16:28,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With our luck like this
we'll reach the goal first.</font>

194
00:16:37,180 --> 00:16:39,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru is frightened
